<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">True Whig Party</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1869">1869</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The True Whig Party is a Liberian political party founded in 1869. It held power without interruption from 1878 to 1980, making Liberia in effect a one-party state dominated by the Americo-Liberian elite under presidents such as <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/charles-d-b-king">Charles D. B. King</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/william-tubman">William Tubman</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/william-tolbert">William Tolbert</a>. Its rule ended with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/samuel-doe">Samuel Doe</a>'s coup in 1980.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/true-whig-party.jpg" alt="True Whig Party" width="320" height="213" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: True Whig Party of Liberia · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:True_Whig_Party_flag.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
